  "post_content": "<p>La Asociaci&oacute;n Cultural y Deportiva &quot;Pas a pas&quot; de Tales organiz&oacute; anoche una cena de carnaval en el sal&oacute;n del Edificio Multifuncional, a la que acudieron unas 130 personas, casi todas disfrazadas.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/02/IMG_9369.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Por dos euros cada persona, la Asociaci&oacute;n facilit&oacute; bebida y picoteo. Tras la cena hubo bingo y baile con el organista y cantante Fran (Sales).</p>\n<p></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarnavaltales/img_9365.jpg\" alt=\"img_9365\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarnavaltales/img_9366.jpg\" alt=\"img_9366\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarnavaltales/img_9367.jpg\" alt=\"img_9367\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarnavaltales/img_9368.jpg\" alt=\"img_9368\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarnavaltales/img_9369.jpg\" alt=\"img_9369\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarnavaltales/img_9370.jpg\" alt=\"img_9370\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarnavaltales/img_9371.jpg\" alt=\"img_9371\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarnavaltales/img_9372.jpg\" alt=\"img_9372\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparcarnavaltales/img_9373.jpg\" alt=\"img_9373\" style=\"ma